{"id":"hilo","lemma":"hilo","pos":"noun","rank":3088,"glosses":["thread, yarn, string","linen","edge of something sharp"],"ipa":"/ˈilo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"hilos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-hilo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella habló con un hilo de voz.","en":"She spoke in a weak voice.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635414","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to talk","l":"hablar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"voice"}]},{"text":"¿Quién mueve los hilos de todo esto?","en":"Who pulls the strings here?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to move","l":"mover"},{"g":"the / them"},null,null,null,{"g":"this"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"all kinds of things"]]},{"text":"¿Tienes hilo dental?","en":"Do you have some dental floss?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"dental"}]},{"text":"El gato enredó todos los hilos.","en":"The cat tangled up all the threads.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"cat"},{"g":"to entangle, to tangle","l":"enredar"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Su vida pende de un hilo.","en":"His life is hanging by a thread.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"to hang, dangle","l":"pender"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}